      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{629b08c4d500080b65918bd9|full_name}: To be more specific for the VRChat developers you nee d to add a ShadowCaster pass to the shaders so they get rendered into the `_CameraDepthTexture`, this can be done either by adding `UsePass \"Legacy Shaders/VertexLit/SHADOWCASTER\"` or manually implementing a ShadowCaster pass\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/540/Documentation/Manual/SL-VertexFragmentShaderExamples.html\n\nSee \"Implementing shadow casting\"",
